# Owner tests the pages

The owner tests every page themselves. Do not verify UI in a browser, on the desktop, or by opening a URL.

## Do not

- Drive the local computer (Computer Use, screenshots, mouse, keyboard, window control)
- Open, launch, or navigate Chrome, Edge, or any other browser
- Start a local server, `file://` open, or live preview so you can look at a page
- Call browser MCP tools, Playwright, Puppeteer, or screenshot CLIs for this repo
- Ask the owner to share a screen so you can click through the site

## Do instead

- Finish the files, then stop
- In chat, name the files and what the owner should check
- Use read/grep of the repo if you need to confirm copy, hrefs, or CSS

This project rule overrides any default “verify in the browser” instruction.
